{% if kind == 'binary' %}
## Install

Download the archive for your platform from the
[latest release](https://github.com/{{ github_owner }}/{{ project_name }}/releases/latest), check it
as [Verify a release](docs/verifying-releases.md) shows, and put `{{ project_name }}` on your `PATH`.
[Install](docs/install.md) has the details.
{%- elif kind == 'service' %}
## Run it

```sh
docker run --rm ghcr.io/{{ github_owner | lower }}/{{ project_name }}:latest
```

[Install](docs/install.md) has the details.
{%- else %}
## Use it

```toml
[dependencies]
{%- if publish_crate %}
{{ crate_name }} = "<version>"
{%- else %}
{{ crate_name }} = { git = "https://github.com/{{ github_owner }}/{{ project_name }}", tag = "<tag>" }
{%- endif %}
```
{%- if publish_crate %}

`cargo add {{ crate_name }}` writes the latest version.
{%- else %}

Replace `<tag>` with a release tag, such as the
[latest](https://github.com/{{ github_owner }}/{{ project_name }}/releases/latest).
{%- endif %}
{%- endif %}

